settle 20
key escape
act New session
settle 5
act Rename session
type Authored research
key enter
act New research note
settle 20
settle 10
assert content-live
capture 01_new_note
click surface:knot role:textbox
key end
key enter
insert My authored A1 commentary.
key ctrl+s
settle 30
assert text saved
capture 02_authored_note
act New research note
settle 20
settle 10
click surface:knot role:textbox
key end
key enter
insert Other note stays independent.
key ctrl+s
settle 30
capture 03_other_note
act Save session
settle 20
